.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt EGGHEAD-MCP 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm egghead-mcp
.Nd MCP stdio server
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm egghead mcp
.Op Fl -config Ar path
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Cm mcp
speaks the Model Context Protocol over standard input and standard
output. It is the transport an editor integration spawns as a
subprocess; the editor writes JSON-RPC requests to stdin, reads
responses from stdout, and tears the process down at the end of the
session. There is one
.Nm
node per editor session.
.Pp
The HTTP MCP transport, mounted at
.Pa /mcp
on the web server, is the right choice when several clients should
share one
.Nm
node or when the client connects from another machine. See
.Xr egghead-serve 1 .
.Pp
Logging is suppressed on this command (the
.Sy :silent
log mode), because standard output carries the wire protocol. Logs
still go to the XDG log file; tail it with
.Xr egghead-logs 1
if you need to debug.
.Pp
When
.Ev EGGHEAD_SERVER
or
.Fl -server
is set, the
.Cm mcp
command attaches to the named
.Cm egghead serve
node over BEAM distribution and brokers MCP requests through it,
giving the editor the same record store and the same agents as the
running node.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--config path"
.It Fl -config Ar path
Override the configuration file location.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show help.
.El
.Sh TOOLS
.Cm mcp
exposes fifteen tools, each prefixed
.Sy egghead_ :
.Pp
.Bl -tag -width "Records" -compact
.It Records
.Sy egghead_search ,
.Sy egghead_get ,
.Sy egghead_list ,
.Sy egghead_create ,
.Sy egghead_update ,
.Sy egghead_find_links ,
.Sy egghead_backlinks ,
.Sy egghead_recent
.It Agents
.Sy egghead_agents ,
.Sy egghead_prompt ,
.Sy egghead_handoff ,
.Sy egghead_save
.It Consultation
.Sy egghead_consult
.It Providers
.Sy egghead_providers ,
.Sy egghead_models
.El
.Pp
.Sy egghead_consult
is the primary integration point for clients that want a one-shot
multi-agent answer without managing rooms themselves.
.Sh EXAMPLES
A minimal
.Pa .mcp.json
that wires
.Cm egghead mcp
into Claude Code or another MCP-aware editor:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "egghead": { "command": "egghead", "args": ["mcp"] }
  }
}
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr egghead-serve 1 ,
.Xr egghead-tools 1 ,
.Xr egghead-logs 1 ,
.Xr egghead 1
